<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.300"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">We're blooming, yeah, we're blooming, baby</text><text for="L2">We're blooming, yeah, we're blooming</text><text for="L3">Wandering inside a young heart, a cosmos</text><text for="L4">Bursting tears and the lost colors</text><text for="L5">But I'm with you, every day and night</text><text for="L6">Embrace all the stars and keep dreamin'</text><text for="L7">Gonna make by breaking me</text><text for="L8">The one-of-a-kind bouquet</text><text for="L9">Glassy serenade</text><text for="L10">So what if I'm clumsy?</text><text for="L11">Under the Milky Way, take my hands</text><text for="L12">To a dream that won't wither</text><text for="L13">I'm taking you there right now</text><text for="L14">When spring passes and winter comes</text><text for="L15">My heart will bloom again</text><text for="L16">Listen to the heartbeat grown louder</text><text for="L17">This moment, to be remembered forever</text><text for="L18">Look at the petals that became lyrics</text><text for="L19">A melody you've already sung</text><text for="L20">L-O-V-E, right?</text><text for="L21">L-O-V-E, right?</text><text for="L22">(I don't doubt it!)</text><text for="L23">Be my, be my light!</text><text for="L24">Be my, be my light!</text><text for="L25">Now then</text><text for="L26">We're blooming, yeah we're blooming, baby</text><text for="L27">We're blooming, can you hug me?</text><text for="L28">Hold up, hold up, I can't breathe</text><text for="L29">I'm ready ready to make it</text><text for="L30">Too much to fit in one breath</text><text for="L31">The words for you just overflow</text><text for="L32">You are like... a dance that makes me laugh</text><text for="L33">Every day, round n' round, arms full of each other</text><text for="L34">No place or time, a dream I want to wake from</text><text for="L35">Gonna zoom, zoom, zoom</text><text for="L36">On just you, you, you</text><text for="L37">Even if we leave the Earth</text><text for="L38">My heart will bloom again</text><text for="L39">Listen to the heartbeat grown louder</text><text for="L40">This moment, to be remembered forever</text><text for="L41">Look at the petals that became lyrics</text><text for="L42">A melody you've already sung</text><text for="L43">L-O-V-E, right?</text><text for="L44">L-O-V-E, right?</text><text for="L45">(I don't doubt it!)</text><text for="L46">Be my, be my light!</text><text for="L47">Be my, be my light!</text><text for="L48">Now then</text><text for="L49">We're blooming, yeah, we're blooming, baby</text><text for="L50">We're blooming, can you hug me?</text><text for="L51">Then I realize</text><text for="L52">The language of all flowers is you</text><text for="L53">(I'm sure, it's you)</text><text for="L54">It's time to get you so I</text><text for="L55">Run, run, run</text><text for="L56">Listen to the heartbeat grown louder</text><text for="L57">This moment, to be remembered forever</text><text for="L58">Look at us, we became lyrics</text><text for="L59">A melody you've already sung</text><text for="L60">L-O-V-E, right?</text><text for="L61">L-O-V-E, right?</text><text for="L62">(I don't doubt it!)</text><text for="L63">Be my, be my light!</text><text for="L64">Be my, be my light!</text><text for="L65">Now then</text><text for="L66">We're blooming, yeah, we're blooming, baby</text><text for="L67">We're blooming, can you hug me?</text><text for="L68">We're blooming, yeah, we're blooming, baby</text><text for="L69">We're blooming, can you hug me?</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Awrii</songwriter><songwriter>Ayushy</songwriter><songwriter>ESUM</songwriter><songwriter>HANRORO</songwriter><songwriter>Josefin Glenmark</songwriter><songwriter>Maribelle Anes</songwriter><songwriter>SSo</songwriter><songwriter>Seora</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration automaticallyCreated="true" xml:lang="ko-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="0.766" end="1.289" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">We're</span> <span begin="1.289" end="2.241" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">blooming,</span> <span begin="2.241" end="2.446" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">yeah,</span> <span begin="2.446" end="2.667" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">we're</span> <span begin="2.667" end="3.547" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">blooming,</span> <span begin="3.547" end="4.098" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">baby</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="4.467" end="5.022" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">We're</span> <span begin="5.022" end="5.892" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">blooming,</span> <span begin="5.892" end="6.059" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">yeah,</span> <span begin="6.059" end="6.392" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">we're</span> <span begin="6.392" end="7.189" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">blooming</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="7.189" end="7.401" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">eo</span> <span begin="7.401" end="7.835" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">rin</span>  <span begin="7.835" end="8.138" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mam</span> <span begin="8.138" end="9.043" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">sok</span>  <span begin="9.043" end="9.281" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">he</span> <span begin="9.281" end="9.536" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mae</span> <span begin="9.536" end="10.001" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">deon</span>  <span begin="10.001" end="10.914" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">Cosmos</span></text><text for="L4"><span begin="10.914" end="11.138" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">teo</span> <span begin="11.138" end="11.411" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">jin</